; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on XAUUSD - best trailing of M10 (tick replay): ATRentry trailing (TrailMode 1), setup 1 of 4: both, session 1200-2000 server time, trend filter M30 EMA 200, target 1.5R. DO NOT LOAD ON BTC.
; Trailing: 1.5 x ATR(14) of M10 at entry behind the best price once the profit reaches 1 x ATR, stop moved once per closed minute. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 1, TrailParam 0).
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (FTMO spread, no commission; score 1.54): 100 trades, PF 1.72. Tick replay of the same months: 98 trades, PF 1.43.
; TICK REPLAY (every tick, the EA's rules; VT costs: Dukascopy ticks with VT's 0.15 spread (scaled by Dukascopy's own spread), 0.60 USD commission per ounce). Unseen May 16 - Nov 13 2026: this setup 44 trades, PF 2.05, net +7.9R (stressed PF 1.75); the 4 setups of M10 + ATRentry together 203 trades, PF 1.57, net +27.9R (stressed 1.38).
; ATRentry was chosen as the best of the EA's trailing systems on M10 by that 2026 result: the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (tick replay, same costs): this setup: Jul 15 - Dec 31 2024, 29 trades, PF 0.59. The 4 setups together: Jul 15 - Dec 31 2024, 154 trades, PF 0.58. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Data: Dukascopy XAUUSD ticks, broker server time. Commission is in the figures: set CommissionPerLot to your round-trip commission per lot.
